  "releaseNotes": "- Added CryptographyType-based dynamic deserialization with AssemblyName fallback\n- Added static cache for cryptography type resolution\n- Added CryptographyTypeAttribute for custom encoders, hashers, and encryptors\n- Moved cryptography extensions into InsaneIO.Insane.Cryptography.Extensions\n- Moved cryptography interfaces into InsaneIO.Insane.Cryptography.Abstractions\n- Split hash algorithm extensions into dedicated classes\n- Added and reorganized tests for separated cryptography extensions\n- Updated Cryptography.md with dynamic deserialization and custom implementation examples\n- Added InsaneIO.CryptSharp.SCrypt as a solution project and project reference",
